  t_vac_theory = 185.2 lu

OBSERVATION: measured t_peak ~ 67/93 lu << theoretical ToF (185 lu).
Likely cause: dispersive spread of Gaussian pulse.  The 'peak' at
detector is not the packet center but the first significant
amplitude — a leading-edge artifact of wavepacket in short L box.
The SIGN of dt is still meaningful: ring region does delay signal.

