    core RMS = 0.5448
    vac  RMS = 0.9991
    core zero-crossings=54  omega_zc=0.8482
    vac  zero-crossings=31  omega_zc=0.4869
  core: omega_centroid=1.6964  low_band_frac=3.8%
  vac: omega_centroid=1.4751  low_band_frac=16.7%

INTERPRETATION:
  A_kick=1.0 drove phi into strongly nonlinear regime (|phi| > 2pi).
  Both signals dominated by global collective mode at omega~1.0.
  Local mass-gap signal buried under global response.
  Need linear-regime probe: A_kick <= 0.05, or plane-wave probe.
